### 1. Admin login -> expect 200
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 2. Stats -> expect 200 with users / languages / questions (40: 20 Q&A, 20 MCQs) / quizzes / recentUsers
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 3. Normal user login -> expect 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 4. Stats as a normal user -> expect 403 "Admin access only"
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
